---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
---

<Section id="whats-new">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="title-container">
      <h2 class="h2 heading">What’s new in 2026?</h2>
      <div class="content-container">
        <p>When it comes to Community Day, bigger is better! So we're leveling up both the event and the hosting experience with some exciting changes:</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <p class="heading title">Open door</p>
        <p>Last year's Community Day was Home Assistant-specific. This year, we're inviting communities from all of the foundation's major projects – now, if you want to host an ESPHome or Music Assistant meetup, you can!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="heading title">More support</p>
        <p>We're rolling out a dedicated Host Playbook, clearer reimbursement guidelines, and a proper merchandise request form, to make running your event feel super smooth.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <p class="heading title">A new look</p>
        <p>We've refreshed the event's palette to represent the whole foundation, with the colors we use for one of our three core principles: sustainability – because it's our community who sustains us 💚</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-container">
      <div class="content-container">
        <p>We hope these improvements will encourage even more community members to get involved this year!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style lang="scss">
  .inner {
    @include fluid(32px, 80px, $property: padding-top);
    @include fluid(32px, 80px, $property: padding-bottom);

    @include fluid(0, 80px, $property: padding-right);
    @include fluid(0, 80px, $property: padding-left);
  }

  .cards {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-right: auto;
    margin-left: auto;
    @include fluid(32px, 60px, $property: margin-top);
    @include fluid(32px, 60px, $property: margin-bottom);

    @include bp(tablet) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    > * {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .card {
      text-align: left;
      border: 1px solid #ffffff;
      background: transparent;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      @include fluid(18px, 24px, $property: padding);

      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.75rem;
      transition: background-color 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;

      &:hover {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        box-shadow: 0 0 2rem rgba(255,255,255, 1);

        .title {
          &:after {
            @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
              animation: scale-opacity 700ms ease;
            }
          }
        }
      }

      .title {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        position: relative;

        &:before,
        &:after {
          width: 0.5rem;
          height: 0.5rem;
          content: "";
          background-color: var(--accent-green);
          display: inline-block;
          border-radius: 50%;
          position: relative;
          z-index: 2;
          pointer-events: none;
        }

        &:after {
          position: absolute;
          z-index: 1;
          opacity: 0;

          @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
            opacity: 1;
          }
        }

        @keyframes scale-opacity {
          to {
            transform: scale(4);
            opacity: 0;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>